      "help": "Moodle as a teacher, through moodle-mcp: building your courses (content, assignments, quizzes, forums, other activities, the gradebook), grading, following the class, checking a course and copying between your sites; my moodle-teacher:* skills hold how to do each well in Moodle, and my week and to-grade skills are quick looks at what's pending.",
